    "description": "•\tMigrated 100+ WEB applications to Azure Cloud PAAS model and configured storage container, Azure kubernetes (AKS), Traffic Manager and some legacy applications to Docker solution \n•\tResponsible for systems architect design (Flowchart/PPT) & capacity planning to ensure best industrial practices when rolling out new applications or for server refresh.\n•\tOS Kernel, Apache, Coherence and Weblogic cluster performance tuning, troubleshooting, heap dump analysis and level 4 support for www.franklintempleton.com and othe 100+ websites\n•\tOn demand SHELL/PERL script writing for automation, FTP, Email attachment extraction, SQL query to deliver reports from database, KeyNote script writing KeyNote monitoring\n•\tManaging development tools such as CVS, SVN, Bamboo,  Jira/Agile, BugZilla, FishEeye, ViewCVS & CAST. Duties includes installation, configuration, upgrade, tuning, patching and user administration.\n•\tAkamai CDN and KeyNote alerts configuration, site traffic and performance analysis/report.\n•\tPrepare web site monthly and quarterly performance report utilizing data collected from Akamai, Unica, Oracle database, Akamai and KeyNote, analyze performance trend, identify bottle neck and provide performance tuning tips to ensure continued application performance.\n•\t24x7 support for over 250 servers consisting of Solaris, Linux and Windows, VMWare ESXi hosts. The duty includes hardware/software support, backup/restore, patching, upgrade and migration.\n",
